{"candidateAnswer":"Rocky Mountains, Jasper, Banff, Canada","evidence":"[D1:2 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! Good to see you! Yeah, I just got back from a trip with my family in my new Prius.\n[D1:4 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: My old prius broke down, decided to get it repaired and sell it. Glad you asked, we went to Rockies, check it out.\n[D2:1 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a3dc541e-3778-5832-8333-ee4db6d0fe7c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:be90319e803440b02fbb2dcdddbe3a9a9270436e60eaaff554015a0e53b5fb20","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where has Evan been on roadtrips with his family?","referenceAnswer":"Rockies, Jasper","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"be90319e803440b02fbb2dcdddbe3a9a9270436e60eaaff554015a0e53b5fb20"}}]}